    {
      "association_text": "Collinsella aerofaciens was among 8 commensal species significantly enriched in pre-treatment stool of metastatic melanoma anti-PD-1 responders (n=16) versus non-responders (n=26) by integrated 16S rRNA, shotgun metagenomic, and qPCR analysis (P<0.05, permutation test); it was part of a 10-species composite qPCR score significantly higher in responders (P=0.004).",
      "content_hash": "3300caf1f79c5434976535fbde82f8b62a4461eb5ce6bb5fca059247adc9068b",
